{"title": "Terminate Bulwark Protocol", "pageid": 23080, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Terminate_Bulwark_Protocol", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp/300px-Generic_Utility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Generic_Utility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Terminate Bulwark Protocol</b> is a free action automatically used by the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a>. After <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\">Defensive Protocol: Bulwark</a> expires, or he loses the temporary HP gained by it, he automatically uses this ability.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>End your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\">Defensive Protocol: Bulwark</a> and return to your normal combat calibration.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.w